{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.0"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-021",
    "title": "三方来使"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_115",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "叶观澜把修补好的地图递给陆照临：“跟我走，去归墟盟总坛。那里有三百年前的原始盟约。”",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "第二枚残印升到半空后，整座灵脉城开始下雪。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3481,
          "end": 3481
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "雪从没有屋顶的石楼间落下，洁白得不合时宜。每一片雪花落地，便化成一小团青光，钻入石缝。街上的无脸人纷纷抬头，空白的脸上第一次出现了类似表情的裂纹。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3483,
          "end": 3483
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“城在重写自己。”慧闻说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3485,
          "end": 3485
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“它会变成什么？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3487,
          "end": 3487
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“取决于谁先拿到残印。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3489,
          "end": 3489
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "城外传来整齐的脚步声。玄霄宗追兵穿过青铜门，领头者正是灰布短褂的弟子。他手里提着一枚黑色令牌，令牌上刻着玄霄宗山门图。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3491,
          "end": 3491
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“陆照临，交出禁物。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3493,
          "end": 3493
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看向顾长离。第二盏灯仍在她怀里，金光已经变成暗红。她的手臂被石屑划开，血迹沿灯柄流下，却没有滴落，反而被灯罩吸收。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3495,
          "end": 3495
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“把灯给我。”灰布弟子说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3497,
          "end": 3497
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“它不属于玄霄宗。”顾长离答。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3499,
          "end": 3499
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“封存工程由玄霄宗主持。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3501,
          "end": 3501
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“清单上写的是三方共同。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3503,
          "end": 3503
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灰布弟子看见她手里的铜片，神色骤变：“那份清单从哪里来的？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3505,
          "end": 3505
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“档房。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3507,
          "end": 3507
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不可能。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3509,
          "end": 3509
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你们可以裁名字，却裁不掉铜片。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3511,
          "end": 3511
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "玄霄宗弟子同时拔剑。剑光照亮雪幕，墙上的无脸人却在此时发出尖锐嘶鸣，黑色铜丝从窗后弹出，缠向所有人的脚踝。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3513,
          "end": 3513
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灰布弟子挥剑斩断铜丝，剑身立刻覆上一层青霜。他踉跄后退，令牌掉在地上。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3515,
          "end": 3515
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜抓住陆照临：“去城心。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3517,
          "end": 3517
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“残印在那边。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3519,
          "end": 3519
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“所以才要去。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3521,
          "end": 3521
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他们沿石阶向黑铁门奔跑。慧闻留在后方，以无相铜镜照住追兵。镜面中的玄霄宗弟子纷纷变成无脸人，彼此挥剑，竟看不清真正的目标。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3523,
          "end": 3523
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离抱着第二盏灯走在最前。灯罩内的暗红光线向城心延伸，照出一串脚印。脚印左外侧有缺口，正是陆沉舟留下的鞋印。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3525,
          "end": 3525
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“他刚来过。”陆照临说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3527,
          "end": 3527
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "脚印停在黑铁门前。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3529,
          "end": 3529
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灵脉城发出巨大的轰鸣。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3555,
          "end": 3555
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "所有石楼同时倾斜，街道像被一只无形巨手揉皱。雪花从空中倒卷，露出灰黑色的天空。无脸人被铜丝拖向城心，窗框一扇接一扇碎裂。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3557,
          "end": 3557
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“残印！”叶观澜喊。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3559,
          "end": 3559
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临伸手抓住空中的第二枚残印。石片入手的一瞬间，掌心旧痕与它拼合，青光贯穿整条手臂。他看见无灯镇的低地、玄霄宗的废井、归墟灵城的城门，三处地方被同一条灵脉连接。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3561,
          "end": 3561
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灵脉尽头站着陆沉舟。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3563,
          "end": 3563
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他背对陆照临，手里提着一盏已经点燃的灯。灯火照亮一座更高的天门，门上没有文字，只有一道尚未闭合的裂缝。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3565,
          "end": 3565
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“父亲！”陆照临喊。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3567,
          "end": 3567
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆沉舟没有回头，只将灯举高。灯火中浮出一句话：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3569,
          "end": 3569
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“第二枚不在城中，城只是它的影子。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3571,
          "end": 3571
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "幻象消失，陆照临口中涌出血腥味。掌心残印与第二枚石片已经短暂拼合，缺口处却仍有一线空白。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3573,
          "end": 3573
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“还缺一角。”慧闻说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3575,
          "end": 3575
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“第三枚残印？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3577,
          "end": 3577
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“或者一个名字。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-050",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3579,
          "end": 3579
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "玄霄宗追兵冲入石厅。灰布弟子看见陆照临手中的石片，厉声道：“放下！”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3581,
          "end": 3581
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜挡在前面：“你们来晚了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-052",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3583,
          "end": 3583
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“交还宗门！”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-053",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3585,
          "end": 3585
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“宗门从未承认它存在。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-054",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3587,
          "end": 3587
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灰布弟子挥剑斩来。顾长离抬灯迎上，暗红灯光将剑势偏开。灯罩内浮出一张模糊面孔，正是她叔父的脸。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-055",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3589,
          "end": 3589
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "她整个人僵住。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-056",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3591,
          "end": 3591
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“记忆不是世事，是每个人的根。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3699,
          "end": 3699
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜在旁边笑了：“说得好听。你们想要的是他记忆里的太虚坐标。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3701,
          "end": 3701
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻看向他：“归墟盟想要的也不只是坐标。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3703,
          "end": 3703
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“至少我们承认想要改写权。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3705,
          "end": 3705
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "三方在旧驿道中央对峙。陆照临握住两只布袋，感到残印的寒意沿手臂上升。他想起灵城石厅里的三条未来：点灯、毁印、带离。每一条都没有安全的结局。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3707,
          "end": 3707
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“玄霄宗能告诉我陆沉舟现在在哪里吗？”他问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3709,
          "end": 3709
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灰袍修士答：“灵城崩塌后，所有人都在寻找他。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3711,
          "end": 3711
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“包括你们？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3713,
          "end": 3713
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“包括宗门。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3715,
          "end": 3715
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那你们为什么说他是失踪的引灯人，不是被太虚遗脉承载的人？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3717,
          "end": 3717
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "灰袍修士沉默。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3719,
          "end": 3719
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜把修补好的地图递给陆照临：“跟我走，去归墟盟总坛。那里有三百年前的原始盟约。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 3721,
          "end": 3721
        }
      }
    ],
